5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need a destination that is financially sustainable. I'm concerned about hidden costs and how we handle last-minute cancellations.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,"Cost is one thing, but efficiency is another. If the environment is poor, the training is wasted. We need to ensure the facilities are actually functional.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I hope we can find a place that isn't too hard to organize. I don't want anyone to be too tired from the planning.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree with Asuka. We cannot afford any budget gaps this year. We need precise figures before we announce anything to the members.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"Forget the budget for a second. The club is split by year-groups. We need a place that actually forces us to bond, not just a cheap room.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Takumi, bonding is useless if the financial burden falls unevenly on a few members. We must prioritize a transparent cost structure first.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Takumi, bonding also fails if everyone is exhausted. I'll look into the actual living conditions and how the schedule affects the members' physical state.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,Maybe we can look at how things were done before? I want to know if some places are easier to book than others.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Minato, that's a good point. We should check the actual receipts from previous years to see where the money actually went.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, I'm not saying ignore the money, but we can't keep drifting apart. I want to know why the last camp failed to bring us together.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,Then let's divide the research. I will focus on the financial terms and the risks associated with group bookings.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shion,,I'll handle the logistics of the stay and the actual impact on the members' condition. I'll check the attendance and the hall's schedule.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,I'll look into the booking process and the cooking duties. I want to see if we can reduce the workload for the organizers.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I will investigate the actual spending and the rates for public beds. We need a hard ceiling on the costs.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I'll look into the social side. I want to know what the seniors think about the year-group divide and how the inland camps worked.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"Agreed. Let's ensure we cover all bases: cost, logistics, and social dynamics.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""norm"":[{""code"":""pass_punct"",""token"":""Over"",""raw"":""Over.""}],""raw"":""Over.""}"
22,1,4,talk,Minato,,I'll do my best to find a way to make it easy for everyone.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Misaki,,Let's be thorough. I don't want any surprises when the final bill arrives.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Takumi,,Just don't pick a place where we all just stay in our own circles.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
