34,2,,status,Takumi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"The whole-building lets are risky. If someone cancels, the remaining members cover the cost. That's an unfair distribution of expense.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shion,,The club hall is out. The timetable is a mess; we'd be training at midnight or dawn. That's a recipe for total exhaustion.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,I found out that public bookings are a nightmare. The application is huge and there's a lottery. It sounds like a lot of work.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,Transport is the real killer. The receipts show that distance exponentially increases the risk of budget overruns. We must stay local.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"I found out that the only way we actually mix is if we're forced into shared living spaces. Inland centres might be too strict, though.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Minato, if the public booking is a lottery, we can't commit to a date. We need a destination with a guaranteed booking process.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Takumi, shared living is fine, but not if the beds are substandard. If we don't sleep, the training quality drops. We need a professional facility.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,"Also, the cooking duty last year was really hard. If we pick a place with a canteen, the organizers won't have to spend their whole camp cooking.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Minato, a canteen sounds convenient, but we need to check the cost. If it's a fixed meal plan, it's easier to budget than self-catering.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Shion, I'd rather have a slightly uncomfortable bed if it means we aren't just sitting in our own year-group circles all night.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Asuka,,I'm leaning away from the whole-building lets. The financial liability for cancellations is too high and logically unsound for a student club.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shion,,"I'm prioritizing a place where the schedule is stable. If we can't guarantee eight hours of sleep, the camp is a failure.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,I really think we should avoid the public lottery. It seems like it would take up all of the organizer's free time just to apply.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"I'm looking at the prefecture rates. Public beds are cheap and predictable. If we combine that with local transport, the budget risk is minimal.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"If we go for the cheapest public beds, we might end up in those inland centres with the strict lights-out. That kills the social bonding.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"We need a balance. A place with a fixed cost per person, a guaranteed booking, and a facility that doesn't require us to pay for ghosts.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shion,,Exactly. A professional facility with a set schedule. No midnight training and no lottery-based gambling with our time.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minato,,I just want to make sure whoever organizes it doesn't have to do everything alone. A place with a canteen and easy booking is best.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"I cannot support any option that leaves the budget open to interpretation. Local, fixed-rate public beds are the only safe bet.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"I'll agree to a budget, but only if the layout of the place encourages us to actually talk to each other.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
